{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_CF65741D","title":"Ava reveals she is the ticket","entry":"Dlg_CF65741D::entry","exit":"Dlg_CF65741D::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_0E9FBF4B","articyId":"72057645577592248","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Thaddeus is waiting for you.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thaddeus is waiting for you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":625.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29213","byteOffset":18932760,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_F3BF5765","articyId":"72057645577592290","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"A new subroutine has been unlocked in my programming. It was designed to open the way to Egress once you were ready. And... you are now ready.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A new subroutine has been unlocked in my programming. It was designed to open the way to Egress once you were ready. And... you are now ready.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2425.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30907","byteOffset":19575560,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_34789E83","articyId":"72057645577592311","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I was unaware of these subroutines. This is all as surprising to me as it is to you. I understand you might now feel... betrayed. Despite this new insight, I remain your friend and companion... if that is what you desire.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I was unaware of these subroutines. This is all as surprising to me as it is to you. I understand you might now feel... betrayed. Despite this new insight, I remain your friend and companion... if that is what you desire.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3025.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33535","byteOffset":20569264,"byteLength":568}},{"id":"DFr_21FAFAAF","articyId":"72057645577592338","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I shall try to regain your trust.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I shall try to regain your trust.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3625.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42969","byteOffset":30585776,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_EED36F73","articyId":"72057645577592344","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"That is a relief. I do not like being used to manipulate you. I will try to repay your trust.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That is a relief. I do not like being used to manipulate you. I will try to repay your trust.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3625.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25280","byteOffset":17446760,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_5A709B64","articyId":"72057645577592360","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Egress. I can unlock the transmitter. And you can talk to Thaddeus.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Egress. I can unlock the transmitter. And you can talk to Thaddeus.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspeci